<title>ITALY: Italy's oil consumption falls 8.7 pct in Feb - tra.</title>
<headline>Italy's oil consumption falls 8.7 pct in Feb - tra.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian consumption of petroleum products fell 8.7 percent to 7.7 million tonnes in February compared with the same month in 1996, according to data from trade group Unione Petrolifera.</p>
<p>  Category		  Feb 1997 (million tonnes)  Chg vs 1996</p>
<p>  Total				 7.7		  -8.7  pct</p>
<p>  Total petrol			 --		  -2.6  pct</p>
<p>  Total diesel oil		   --		 -10.7  pct</p>
<p>Note: Unione Petrolifera said in a statement that as seen in January demand for fuel oil in power plants again fell, down 16 percent in February.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
